Scope. The MIT terms above cover the hand-written parts of this repository:
src/overrides.css, the generator page, and the scripts.

src/theme-generated.css is the output of Angular Material's own theming code
(MIT, https://github.com/angular/material), produced by configuring palettes
and collecting the stylesheet it generates.

SOGo itself is GPL and is not included or modified here. This repository
changes nothing inside SOGo's package tree: everything installs to
/usr/local/share and is served in front of the packaged files by Apache
aliases, so a SOGo upgrade leaves it intact and removing one file reverts it.
